# Grand Abolisher: "your opponents can't ... activate abilities of artifacts, creatures, or enchantments" is about who
# activates, not who controls the source. Bot1 controls Grand Abolisher and Land's Edge ("Discard a land card: ... Any player
# may activate this ability"). On Bot2's turn 2 Bot2 activates Bot1's Land's Edge, discarding a Mountain: 2 damage to Bot1. On
# Bot1's turn 3 Bot2 may not activate it, though Bot1 controls the enchantment, and Bot1 still may.

